+ * The show commands against a real magazine.
+ *
+ * A crew does not compile a show against the catalog on the day. They compile it
+ * against the store, with whatever the importer failed to deliver already
+ * missing and whatever the recall notice named already set aside, so these are
+ * the runs that matter the week of a show.
